stdlib + guard + replace: strconv.ParseInt errors are wrapped "amount %q: %w" unless errors.Is(err, strconv.ErrRange),
which is replaced by *domain.ValidationError.
Expect strconv.ErrSyntax (and ParseInt's opaque base/bit-size errors) behind (*strconv.NumError).Unwrap + "amount %q: %w",
two concrete *domain.ValidationError; strconv.ErrRange must NOT appear.
-- args --
parse/parse.go:@amount
